function getForm(){if(!$f('f-form'))return draft;const f=Object.fromEntries(new FormData($f('f-form')));delete f.symptom;f.symptoms=[...$f('f-form').querySelectorAll('[name=symptom]:checked')].map(x=>x.value);schema.filter(x=>x[3]==='number').forEach(x=>f[x[0]]=f[x[0]]===''?null:Number(f[x[0]]));return f}
function fieldHTML(s){const [id,a,b,type,,attrs='']=s,val=draft[id]??(id==='visit'?today():'');let control;if(opt[type])control=`<select name="${id}" id="f-${id}">${opt[type].map(([v,e,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===val?'selected':''}>${E(T(e,n))}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;else if(type==='parasite')control=`<select name="parasite" id="f-parasite"><option value="">${T('Sin observar / sin identificar','Not observed / unidentified')}</option>${HOSTS.entries.map(p=>`<option value="${E(p.latin)}" ${val===p.latin?'selected':''}>${E(p.latin)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;else if(type==='textarea')control=`<textarea name="${id}" id="f-${id}" rows="4" ${attrs}>${E(val)}</textarea>`;else control=`<input name="${id}" id="f-${id}" type="${type}" value="${E(val)}" ${attrs} ${type==='date'?'max="'+today()+'"':''}>`;return `<label>${E(T(a,b))}${control}</label>`}
function render(){document.querySelectorAll('.field-nav').forEach(e=>e.textContent=T('Mi parcela','My field'));document.querySelectorAll('.field-nav-sub').forEach(e=>e.textContent=T('Escáner, visitas e informes','Scanner, visits and reports'));$f('parcelas').innerHTML=`<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">06 / ${T('MI PARCELA','MY FIELD')}</span><h2>${T('Escáner de agricultura','Agricultural scanner')}</h2><p>${T('Tu observación, el historial del campo y el contexto de NASA.','Your observations, field history and NASA context.')}</p></div><span class="outline-pill">${T('Observación asistida · no es un sensor','Assisted observation · not a sensor')}</span></div><div class="f-banner"><b>${T('Una parcela. Ocho miradas para cuidarla.','One field. Eight perspectives to care for it.')}</b><p>${T('Organizá tus visitas y consultá datos regionales fechados. Este escáner no diagnostica enfermedades ni certifica aptitud: explica qué conviene revisar y qué información falta.','Organize visits and consult dated regional data. This scanner does not diagnose diseases or certify suitability: it explains what to review and what information is missing.')}</p></div><div class="f-toolbar"><label>${T('Mis parcelas','My fields')}<select id="f-field"><option value="">${T('Nueva parcela sin guardar','New unsaved field')}</option>${book.fields.map(p=>`<option value="${E(p.id)}" ${p.id===selected?'selected':''}>${E(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button id="f-new" class="secondary-button">${T('＋ Nueva parcela','＋ New field')}</button><button id="f-backup" class="secondary-button">${T('↓ Copia del cuaderno','↓ Notebook backup')}</button></div><div class="f-layout"><div class="f-form-card"><div class="f-steps">${[T('1 · Parcela','1 · Field'),T('2 · Observación','2 · Observation'),T('3 · Árboles y parásitas','3 · Trees and parasites')].map((s,i)=>`<button type="button" data-step="${i}">${s}</button>`).join('')}</div><form id="f-form" novalidate>${[0,1,2].map(n=>`<fieldset data-formstep="${n}"><legend>${[T('Identificá lugar y planta','Identify place and plant'),T('Una visita que se pueda comparar','A visit you can compare'),T('La parásita y su hospedante','The parasite and its host')][n]}</legend>${n===1?'<div class="f-symptoms">'+symptoms.map(([k,a,b])=>`<label><input type="checkbox" name="symptom" value="${k}" ${draft.symptoms?.includes(k)?'checked':''}>${T(a,b)}</label>`).join('')+'</div>':''}<div class="f-fields">${schema.filter(x=>x[4]===n).map(fieldHTML).join('')}</div>${n===0?`<button type="button" id="f-use-map" class="secondary-button">${T('Usar punto seleccionado en el mapa','Use selected map point')}</button><p class="tiny">${T('Confirmá las coordenadas. Solo ubicación y fechas se envían a NASA al consultar, no tus nombres ni notas.','Confirm the coordinates. Only location and dates are sent to NASA when querying, not your names or notes.')}</p>`:n===1?`<p class="tiny">${T('Son tus mediciones, no detecciones NASA. Las fotografías se conservan por separado; registrá sus nombres de archivo.','These are your measurements, not NASA detections. Photos are kept separately; record their filenames.')}</p>`:'<div id="f-host-guide"></div>'}</fieldset>`).join('')}<datalist id="f-crops">${plantCatalog.map(p=>`<option value="${E(pageLanguage==='en'?translateText(p.name):p.name)}">${E(p.latin)}</option>`).join('')}</datalist><div class="f-step-nav"><button type="button" id="f-prev" class="secondary-button">${T('← Atrás','← Back')}</button><button type="button" id="f-next" class="secondary-button">${T('Continuar →','Continue →')}</button></div><div class="f-submit"><button id="f-scan" class="button" ${busy?'disabled':''}>${T('◈ Revisar con NASA','◈ Review with NASA')}</button><button id="f-local" type="button" class="secondary-button">${T('Revisar solo mis notas','Review my notes only')}</button></div><p id="f-status" role="status"></p><p class="tiny">${T('El formulario no se guarda solo. Guardá la visita después de revisar el informe. Los registros quedan en este navegador; exportá copias para conservarlos.','The form does not save itself. Save the visit after reviewing the report. Records stay in this browser; export backups to keep them.')}</p></form></div><div class="f-dashboard"><span class="eyebrow">${T('TELEMETRÍA DE CONTEXTO','CONTEXT TELEMETRY')}</span><div id="f-result" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="f-layers" class="f-layer-grid"></div><article id="f-detail"></article><div id="f-advice"></div><div class="f-actions"><button id="f-save" class="button">${T('✓ Guardar visita','✓ Save visit')}</button><button id="f-print" class="secondary-button">${T('↓ Informe imprimible','↓ Printable report')}</button><button id="f-json" class="secondary-button">${T('↓ Datos del informe','↓ Report data')}</button></div><p id="f-saved" role="status"></p></div></div><div class="f-history"><h3>${T('Visitas y evolución de la parcela','Field visits and progression')}</h3><div id="f-history"></div></div>`;
setStep(step);bind();renderHost();dashboard();historyView();}
function setStep(n){step=Math.min(2,Math.max(0,n));document.querySelectorAll('[data-formstep]').forEach(x=>x.hidden=+x.dataset.formstep!==step);document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]').forEach(x=>{x.classList.toggle('selected',+x.dataset.step===step);x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(+x.dataset.step===step))});$f('f-prev').disabled=step===0;$f('f-next').hidden=step===2;}
function invalidate(){seq++;controller?.abort();busy=false;report=null;message=null;draft=getForm();$f('f-scan').disabled=false;dashboard();}
function validate(){for(const x of $f('f-form').querySelectorAll('input,select,textarea')){x.setCustomValidity('');if(x.id==='f-affected'&&x.value!==''&&$f('f-inspected').value!==''&&+x.value>+$f('f-inspected').value)x.setCustomValidity(T('No puede superar la muestra inspeccionada.','Cannot exceed the inspected sample.'));if(x.id==='f-first'&&x.value&&x.value>$f('f-visit').value)x.setCustomValidity(T('No puede ser posterior a la visita.','Cannot be later than the visit.'));if(!x.checkValidity()){setStep(+x.closest('[data-formstep]').dataset.formstep);x.reportValidity();return false}}return true}
const MET=['T2M','T2M_MIN','T2M_MAX','PRECTOTCORR','GWETROOT','RH2M','WS2M'],UV=['ALLSKY_SFC_UVA','ALLSKY_SFC_UVB','ALLSKY_SFC_UV_INDEX'];
async function fetchNASA(f,keys,start,end,signal){const url='https://power.larc.nasa.gov/api/temporal/daily/point?'+new URLSearchParams({parameters:keys.join(','),community:'AG',latitude:f.lat.toFixed(4),longitude:f.lon.toFixed(4),start:start.replaceAll('-',''),end:end.replaceAll('-',''),format:'JSON','time-standard':'UTC'});const c=cache.get(url);if(c&&Date.now()-c.at<3600000)return c.value;const res=await fetch(url,{signal});if(!res.ok)throw Error('NASA HTTP '+res.status);const json=await res.json(),value={data:aggregate(json,keys),url,start,end,queried:new Date().toISOString(),sources:json.header?.sources||[]};if(cache.size>24)cache.delete(cache.keys().next().value);cache.set(url,{at:Date.now(),value});return value;}
async function scan(remote){if(!validate())return;draft=getForm();seq++;controller?.abort();const current=seq,ac=new AbortController();controller=ac;report={id:null,fieldId:selected||null,created:new Date().toISOString(),form:{...draft},env:{met:null,uv:null},remote};message=null;busy=remote;layer='rain';$f('f-scan').disabled=remote;dashboard();if(!remote)return;const end=draft.visit<shift(today(),-7)?draft.visit:shift(today(),-7),timer=setTimeout(()=>ac.abort(),55000);const results=await Promise.allSettled([fetchNASA(draft,MET,shift(end,-29),end,ac.signal),fetchNASA(draft,UV,shift(end,-179),end,ac.signal)]);clearTimeout(timer);if(current!==seq)return;['met','uv'].forEach((k,i)=>{if(results[i].status==='fulfilled')report.env[k]=results[i].value;else report.env[k+'Error']=String(results[i].reason?.message||'Unavailable')});busy=false;$f('f-scan').disabled=false;dashboard();}
function optionLabel(k,v){const s=schema.find(x=>x[0]===k),o=opt[s?.[3]]?.find(x=>x[0]===v);return o?T(o[1],o[2]):(v===null||v===undefined||v===''?'—':v)}
function advice(r){const f=r.form,a=[],add=(e,n)=>a.push(T(e,n));if(f.structural==='yes')add('Reportaste daño estructural: mantené distancia de ramas inestables y solicitá una evaluación presencial.','You reported structural damage: keep clear of unstable branches and request an in-person assessment.');if(f.severity==='severe'||f.progress==='fast')add('La prioridad surge de la intensidad o el avance que anotaste. Documentá los cambios y consultá a un técnico local.','Priority comes from the severity or progression you recorded. Document changes and consult a local specialist.');if(f.soil==='dry')add('Reportaste suelo seco: medí a profundidad de raíces antes de definir riego. La lluvia regional no equivale a agua útil de tu lote.','You reported dry soil: measure at root depth before deciding irrigation. Regional rainfall does not equal field-available water.');if(f.soil==='flooded')add('Registrá cuánto dura el anegamiento y revisá drenaje y raíces; evitá tránsito que agrave la compactación.','Record waterlogging duration and inspect drainage and roots; avoid traffic that worsens compaction.');if(f.symptoms.includes('yellow')||f.symptoms.includes('wilt'))add('Amarillamiento y marchitez pueden tener causas hídricas, radiculares, nutricionales u otras. Este informe no los atribuye a UV ni a una enfermedad específica.','Yellowing and wilting can have water, root, nutritional or other causes. This report does not attribute them to UV or a specific disease.');const host=HOSTS.entries.find(x=>x.latin===f.parasite);if(host)a.push(host[pageLanguage==='en'?'en':'es'].next);if(f.parasite&&f.confirmation!=='confirmed')add('La parásita está sin confirmar. Identificá por separado parásita y hospedante; registrá la unión y el ejemplar completo.','The parasite is unconfirmed. Identify parasite and host separately; record the attachment and whole specimen.');const m=r.env.met?.data;if(m?.T2M_MAX?.max>=35)add('La celda regional tuvo máximas de al menos 35 °C: revisá fechas, variedad y etapa. No es un umbral universal de daño ni temperatura superficial del cultivo.','The regional cell had maxima of at least 35 °C: check dates, variety and stage. This is not a universal injury threshold or crop surface temperature.');if(m?.T2M_MIN?.count&&m.T2M_MIN.min<=0)add('Hubo mínimas regionales de 0 °C o menos. Contrastá con microclimas y observación local; no es pronóstico de heladas.','Regional minima reached 0 °C or below. Check local microclimates and observations; this is not a frost forecast.');add('La salud del suelo requiere análisis representativos de pH, nutrientes, materia orgánica y restricciones físicas. No se calcula una puntuación ficticia de fertilidad.','Soil health needs representative pH, nutrient, organic matter and physical-condition tests. No invented fertility score is calculated.');if(!f.photos)add('Anotá referencias de fotos: planta completa, detalle y una planta comparable sin síntomas.','Record photo references: whole plant, detail and a comparable symptom-free plant.');add('Repetí la visita en el mismo punto y con el mismo método. Anotá las acciones realizadas y los cambios, sin asumir causalidad.','Repeat the visit at the same point with the same method. Record actions and changes without assuming causation.');return a}
const names={rain:['☂ Lluvia','☂ Rain'],soil:['◉ Humedad del suelo','◉ Soil moisture'],heat:['☀ Temperatura','☀ Temperature'],vegetation:['🌱 Vegetación','🌱 Vegetation'],water:['💧 Agua y riego','💧 Water and irrigation'],health:['✚ Estado observado','✚ Observed condition'],uv:['◌ Radiación UV','◌ UV radiation'],wind:['≋ Viento','≋ Wind']};
function layers(r){const f=r.form,m=r.env.met?.data,u=r.env.uv?.data,period=r.env.met?r.env.met.start+' → '+r.env.met.end:T('Sin datos NASA','No NASA data');const v=(k,unit,stat='mean')=>m?.[k]?.count?fmt(m[k][stat])+' '+unit:'—';const local=T('Registro propio','Farmer record')+' · '+f.visit;return {
rain:{value:v('PRECTOTCORR','mm','sum'),origin:'NASA POWER · '+period,key:'PRECTOTCORR',map:'rain',detail:T('Acumulado de días válidos. No prueba anegamiento ni reemplaza al pluviómetro.','Sum of valid days. It does not establish waterlogging or replace a rain gauge.')},
soil:{value:v('GWETROOT','/ 1'),origin:T('NASA · humedad radicular modelada','NASA · modeled root-zone wetness')+' · '+period,key:'GWETROOT',map:'soil',detail:T('Índice 0–1, no porcentaje volumétrico. Tu medición: ','A 0–1 index, not volumetric percentage. Your reading: ')+fmt(f.moisture)+' % · '+fmt(f.depth)+' cm · '+(f.method||'—')},
heat:{value:v('T2M_MAX','°C','max'),origin:T('NASA · máxima del período a 2 m','NASA · period maximum at 2 m')+' · '+period,key:'T2M_MAX',map:'heat',detail:T('Temperatura del aire, no calor superficial. Mínima: ','Air temperature, not surface heat. Minimum: ')+v('T2M_MIN','°C','min')+T('. Contrastá con la etapa del cultivo.','. Check against crop stage.')},
vegetation:{value:f.cover===null?'—':fmt(f.cover)+' %',origin:local,map:'vegetation',detail:T('Cobertura anotada por vos. No es NDVI. El mapa MODIS aporta contexto regional; no extraemos un índice de sus colores ni identificamos especies.','Cover recorded by you. This is not NDVI. The MODIS map provides regional context; we do not extract an index from its colours or identify species.')},
water:{value:f.irrigation===null?'—':fmt(f.irrigation)+' mm',origin:local,map:'soil',detail:optionLabel('water',f.water)+'. '+T('Riego aplicado en esta visita, no demanda recomendada. Faltan agua útil, evapotranspiración y eficiencia para un balance hídrico.','Irrigation applied on this visit, not recommended demand. Available water, evapotranspiration and efficiency are needed for a water balance.')},
health:{value:ratio(f.affected,f.inspected)===null?'—':fmt(ratio(f.affected,f.inspected))+' %',origin:local,map:'vegetation',detail:T('Con síntomas / inspeccionadas: ','Symptomatic / inspected: ')+(f.affected??'—')+' / '+(f.inspected??'—')+'. '+T('No extrapolar a toda la parcela. Intensidad: ','Do not extrapolate to the whole field. Severity: ')+optionLabel('severity',f.severity)+'. '+optionLabel('progress',f.progress)},
uv:{value:u?.ALLSKY_SFC_UV_INDEX?.last?fmt(u.ALLSKY_SFC_UV_INDEX.last[1],2):'—',origin:T('NASA · UVI medio diario histórico','NASA · historical daily mean UVI')+' · '+date(u?.ALLSKY_SFC_UV_INDEX?.last?.[0]),key:'ALLSKY_SFC_UV_INDEX',detail:T('No es el UV actual ni el máximo del mediodía. No se aplican categorías de riesgo humano a este promedio ni se deduce daño vegetal. La respuesta depende de especie, exposición, agua y nutrientes.','This is neither current UV nor the noon maximum. Human risk categories are not applied to this mean and plant injury is not inferred. Response depends on species, exposure, water and nutrients.')},
wind:{value:v('WS2M','m/s'),origin:T('NASA · media del período a 2 m','NASA · period mean at 2 m')+' · '+period,key:'WS2M',map:'wind',detail:T('No muestra ráfagas ni decide si se puede aplicar un producto hoy. Contrastá con medición y pronóstico local.','It does not show gusts or determine whether a product can be applied today. Check local measurements and forecasts.')}
}}
function dashboard(){for(const id of ['f-save','f-print','f-json'])$f(id).disabled=!report||busy||(id==='f-save'&&!!report?.id);$f('f-saved').textContent=message?T(...message):'';$f('f-status').textContent=busy?T('Consultando clima y UV por separado…','Querying climate and UV separately…'):report?T('Informe disponible. Revisá fechas, cobertura y procedencia.','Report available. Check dates, coverage and provenance.'):T('Borrador sin analizar ni guardar.','Draft not reviewed or saved.');if(!report){$f('f-result').innerHTML='<h3>'+T('Tu registro completa el satélite','Your record complements the satellite')+'</h3><p>'+T('Completá ubicación y planta para empezar. Donde falten datos verás un guion, no un estado saludable supuesto.','Enter location and plant to begin. Missing data show a dash, not an assumed healthy state.')+'</p>';$f('f-layers').innerHTML=Object.values(names).map(n=>`<div class="f-layer">${T(...n)}<b>—</b></div>`).join('');$f('f-detail').innerHTML='';$f('f-advice').innerHTML='';return}const f=report.form,c=care(f),title=c==='priority'?T('Revisión local prioritaria','Priority local review'):c==='review'?T('Revisar en campo','Review in the field'):T('Completar evidencia y seguir','Complete evidence and monitor');$f('f-result').innerHTML=`<div class="f-assessment ${c}"><small>${E(f.name)} · ${E(f.visit)}</small><h3>${title}</h3><p>${E(f.crop)} · ${fmt(f.lat,4)}, ${fmt(f.lon,4)}</p><p>${T('Nivel basado en tus señales y su evolución. No certifica salud ni aptitud.','Level based on your reported signs and progression. It does not certify health or suitability.')}</p></div>`;const ls=layers(report);$f('f-layers').innerHTML=Object.entries(ls).map(([k,v])=>`<button type="button" data-layer-field="${k}" class="f-layer ${k===layer?'selected':''}" aria-pressed="${k===layer}"><span>${T(...names[k])}</span><b>${E(v.value)}</b><small>${E(v.origin)}</small></button>`).join('');$f('f-layers').querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{layer=b.dataset.layerField;dashboard()});const x=ls[layer],source=layer==='uv'?report.env.uv:report.env.met,count=source?.data[x.key]?.count;let extra='';if(layer==='uv')extra='<div class="f-uv">'+['ALLSKY_SFC_UVA','ALLSKY_SFC_UVB'].map(k=>{const v=source?.data[k];return `<p><b>${k.endsWith('UVA')?'UVA':'UVB'}: ${v?.last?fmt(v.last[1],3)+' '+E(v.units):'—'}</b> · ${date(v?.last?.[0])}</p>`}).join('')+'</div><p>'+T('NASA CERES: celda aproximada de 1° × 1°. Publicación con meses de demora; UVA/UVB son energía diaria. Cada valor conserva su propia fecha válida. No se rellenan faltantes.','NASA CERES: approximately 1° × 1° cell. Publication lags by months; UVA/UVB are daily energy. Each value retains its own valid date. Missing values are not filled.')+'</p><a href="https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/methodology/data/sources_fluxes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NASA · UV</a> · <a href="https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/ultraviolet-radiation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">'+T('UV y plantas','UV and plants')+'</a>';
$f('f-detail').innerHTML=`<span class="eyebrow">${T('CAPA SELECCIONADA','SELECTED LAYER')}</span><h3>${T(...names[layer])}</h3><p>${E(x.detail)}</p>${extra}${count!==undefined?`<p class="tiny">${T('Días válidos','Valid days')}: ${count}/${layer==='uv'?180:30}. ${T('Último día válido','Latest valid day')}: ${date(source.data[x.key].last?.[0])}</p>`:''}${source&&x.key?`<p class="tiny">${T('Consultado','Queried')}: ${E(source.queried)} · ${layer==='uv'?'CERES SYN1deg':'MERRA-2 / POWER · 0,5° × 0,625°'}</p><a href="${E(source.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${T('Respuesta original NASA ↗','Original NASA response ↗')}</a>`:x.key?`<p class="f-warning">${busy?T('Consulta en curso.','Query in progress.'):T('Sin datos NASA en esta capa. No se sustituyen por valores simulados.','No NASA data for this layer. Simulated values are not substituted.')}</p>`:''}${x.map?`<button type="button" id="f-map" class="secondary-button">${T('Ver mapa global como apoyo ↗','View global map for context ↗')}</button>`:''}`;if($f('f-map'))$f('f-map').onclick=()=>{state.span=2;choose(f.lat,f.lon,f.name);showSection('monitor');document.querySelector('[data-layer="'+x.map+'"]').click()};$f('f-advice').innerHTML='<h3>'+T('Observación para esta visita','Observation for this visit')+'</h3><ol>'+advice(report).map(a=>'<li>'+E(a)+'</li>').join('')+'</ol><p class="tiny">'+T('Reglas explicables, no diagnóstico automático ni IA entrenada. NASA aporta contexto ambiental, no identifica parásitas ni prescribe tratamientos.','Explainable rules, not automatic diagnosis or trained AI. NASA provides environmental context; it does not identify parasites or prescribe treatments.')+'</p>';}
function hostHTML(latin,button=false){const entry=HOSTS.entries.find(p=>p.latin===latin),lang=pageLanguage==='en'?'en':'es';if(!entry)return '<p class="f-warning">'+E(HOSTS.hostNaming[lang])+'</p>';const h=entry[lang];return `<div class="f-host"><span class="eyebrow">${T('PARÁSITA Y HOSPEDANTE','PARASITE AND HOST')}</span><h3><i>${E(latin)}</i></h3><p>${E(h.hosts)}</p><p class="f-warning">${E(h.uncertainty)}</p><h4>${T('Qué registrar','What to record')}</h4><p>${E(h.symptoms)}</p><h4>${T('Próximo paso','Next step')}</h4><p>${E(h.next)}</p><details><summary>${T('Nombres locales y fuentes','Local names and sources')}</summary><p>${E(HOSTS.hostNaming[lang])}</p>${entry.sources.map((k,i)=>`<a href="${E(HOSTS.sources[k])}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${T('Fuente','Source')} ${i+1} ↗</a>`).join(' · ')}</details>${button?`<button type="button" data-report-parasite="${E(latin)}" class="button">${T('Reportar en mi parcela','Report in my field')}</button>`:''}</div>`}
function renderHost(){if($f('f-host-guide'))$f('f-host-guide').innerHTML=hostHTML($f('f-parasite').value)}
function saveVisit(){if(!report||busy||report.id)return;const id=selected||crypto.randomUUID();selected=id;report.fieldId=id;report.id=crypto.randomUUID();const f=report.form,profile={id,name:f.name,crop:f.crop,lat:f.lat,lon:f.lon,area:f.area,water:f.water};const at=book.fields.findIndex(p=>p.id===id);if(at>=0)book.fields[at]=profile;else book.fields.push(profile);book.visits.push(structuredClone(report));try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(book));message=['Visita guardada en este navegador. Exportá una copia para conservarla.','Visit saved in this browser. Export a copy to keep it.']}catch{message=['No se pudo guardar en el navegador. La visita solo está en esta sesión: exportá el cuaderno ahora.','Could not save in the browser. This visit is only in this session: export the notebook now.']}draft=getForm();render()}
function historyView(){const visits=book.visits.filter(v=>!selected||v.fieldId===selected).slice().reverse();$f('f-history').innerHTML=visits.length?`<div class="f-table"><table><thead><tr>${[T('Visita','Visit'),T('Parcela / planta','Field / plant'),T('Evolución','Progression'),T('Con síntomas','Symptomatic'),T('Cobertura','Cover'),T('Informe','Report')].map(s=>'<th>'+s+'</th>').join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${visits.map(v=>`<tr><td>${E(v.form.visit)}</td><td>${E(v.form.name)}<br><small>${E(v.form.crop)}</small></td><td>${E(optionLabel('progress',v.form.progress))}</td><td>${fmt(ratio(v.form.affected,v.form.inspected))} %</td><td>${fmt(v.form.cover)} %</td><td><button class="secondary-button" data-visit="${E(v.id)}">${T('Abrir','Open')}</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="tiny">${T('Cada informe conserva la consulta original. Compará visitas al mismo punto y con el mismo método; no se infiere una tendencia a partir de muestras diferentes.','Each report preserves its original query. Compare visits at the same point using the same method; different samples do not establish a trend.')}</p>`:'<p>'+T('Todavía no hay visitas guardadas.','No saved visits yet.')+'</p>';$f('f-history').querySelectorAll('[data-visit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{seq++;controller?.abort();busy=false;const v=book.visits.find(v=>v.id===b.dataset.visit);selected=v.fieldId;report=structuredClone(v);draft={...v.form};message=null;render();$f('f-result').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'})})}
function download(name,content,type){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([content],{type})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
function exportReport(){if(!report)return;download('TerraJujuy-informe.json',JSON.stringify({...report,language:pageLanguage,observations:advice(report)},null,2),'application/json')}
function printReport(){if(!report)return;const ls=layers(report),f=report.form;const body=`<h1>TerraJujuy · ${T('Informe de parcela','Field report')}</h1><p>${E(f.name)} · ${E(f.visit)} · ${E(f.crop)}</p><p>${T('Generado','Generated')}: ${E(report.created)} · ${T('Idioma','Language')}: ${pageLanguage}</p><h2>${T('Observaciones aportadas','Reported observations')}</h2><dl>${schema.map(s=>`<dt>${E(T(s[1],s[2]))}</dt><dd>${E(optionLabel(s[0],f[s[0]]))}</dd>`).join('')}</dl><p>${T('Señales','Signs')}: ${symptoms.filter(s=>f.symptoms.includes(s[0])).map(s=>E(T(s[1],s[2]))).join(', ')||'—'}</p><h2>${T('Capas y procedencia','Layers and provenance')}</h2>${Object.entries(ls).map(([k,v])=>`<article><h3>${T(...names[k])}: ${E(v.value)}</h3><p>${E(v.origin)}</p><p>${E(v.detail)}</p></article>`).join('')}<h2>NASA POWER</h2>${['met','uv'].map(k=>{const s=report.env[k];return s?`<p>${E(s.start)} — ${E(s.end)} · ${T('Consulta','Query')}: ${E(s.queried)}</p><a href="${E(s.url)}">NASA API</a><table><tr><th>${T('Variable','Parameter')}</th><th>${T('Días válidos','Valid days')}</th><th>${T('Último valor válido','Last valid value')}</th><th>${T('Fecha','Date')}</th><th>${T('Unidad','Unit')}</th></tr>${Object.entries(s.data).map(([p,v])=>`<tr><td>${E(p)}</td><td>${v.count}</td><td>${fmt(v.last?.[1],3)}</td><td>${date(v.last?.[0])}</td><td>${E(v.units)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</table>`:'<p>'+T('Sin datos para','No data for')+' '+k+'</p>'}).join('')}<p>${T('Clima: celda MERRA-2 de 0,5° × 0,625°. Radiación: CERES de aproximadamente 1° × 1°. No son sensores de parcela. El UVI es promedio diario histórico, no máximo ni UV actual; no permite diagnosticar daño en una planta.','Weather: MERRA-2 0.5° × 0.625° cell. Radiation: approximately 1° × 1° CERES cell. These are not field sensors. UVI is a historical daily mean, not peak or current UV; it cannot diagnose plant injury.')}</p><h2>${T('Qué revisar','What to review')}</h2><ol>${advice(report).map(a=>'<li>'+E(a)+'</li>').join('')}</ol>${f.parasite?hostHTML(f.parasite):''}<p>${T('Apoyo a la observación; requiere validación agrícola local. NASA no identifica parásitas ni prescribe tratamientos.','Observation support; requires local agricultural validation. NASA does not identify parasites or prescribe treatment.')}</p>`;download('TerraJujuy-informe.html','<!doctype html><html lang="'+pageLanguage+'"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>TerraJujuy</title><style>body{font:16px/1.5 system-ui;max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;padding:24px;color:#163c30}h1,h2{color:#126b4c}dt{font-weight:700}dd{margin-bottom:12px;white-space:pre-wrap}article{border-top:1px solid #ccc}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px}td,th{padding:6px;border:1px solid #ddd}a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}p{white-space:pre-wrap}@media print{body{margin:0}article{break-inside:avoid}}</style><body>'+body+'</body></html>','text/html')}
function bind(){$f('f-form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();scan(true)};$f('f-form').addEventListener('input',invalidate);$f('f-form').addEventListener('change',e=>{invalidate();if(e.target.name==='parasite')renderHost()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setStep(+b.dataset.step));$f('f-prev').onclick=()=>setStep(step-1);$f('f-next').onclick=()=>setStep(step+1);$f('f-local').onclick=()=>scan(false);$f('f-use-map').onclick=()=>{$f('f-lat').value=state.selectedLat??state.lat;$f('f-lon').value=state.selectedLon??state.lon;invalidate()};$f('f-save').onclick=saveVisit;$f('f-json').onclick=exportReport;$f('f-print').onclick=printReport;$f('f-backup').onclick=()=>download('TerraJujuy-cuaderno.json',JSON.stringify(book,null,2),'application/json');$f('f-new').onclick=()=>{seq++;controller?.abort();busy=false;selected='';draft={};report=null;message=null;step=0;render()};$f('f-field').onchange=e=>{seq++;controller?.abort();busy=false;selected=e.target.value;draft={...(book.fields.find(p=>p.id===selected)||{}),visit:today()};report=null;message=null;step=0;render()};}

